#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2252 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "PLAN-function-surface-wave1 phase 3: the no-dictionary SKIP pin for the unii type (K4-DICT, once per dictionary type). Violating-shaped data (row 2 pairs the ASPIRIN UNII code with IBUPROFEN) but #dictionaries is DELIBERATELY ABSENT, so the rule MUST report SKIPPED, never a false PASS and never a finding. Red under the phase-3 S3a/S3b sabotage by design."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | CURTRT | ASPIRIN   | R16CO5Y76E
S01 | TS | 2 | CURTRT | IBUPROFEN | R16CO5Y76E
